WEBVTT

00:28:26.841 --> 00:28:30.654
I think that while I hated being depressed

00:28:30.678 --> 00:28:33.180
and would hate to be depressed again,

00:28:33.204 --> 00:28:35.267
I've found a way to love my depression.

00:28:35.894 --> 00:28:40.077
I love it because it has forced me
to find and cling to joy.

00:28:40.681 --> 00:28:44.270
I love it because each day I decide,

00:28:44.294 --> 00:28:45.683
sometimes gamely,

00:28:45.707 --> 00:28:48.252
and sometimes against the moment's reason,

00:28:48.276 --> 00:28:50.415
to cleave to the reasons for living.

00:28:50.978 --> 00:28:54.655
And that, I think,
is a highly privileged rapture.

00:28:55.076 --> 00:28:56.332
Thank you.

00:28:56.356 --> 00:29:00.357
(Applause)